{"type":"message","id":"b15e1bdc","parentId":"83f310d7","timestamp":"2026-03-08T15:18:50.036Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is reassuring me that I shouldn't worry, that I'm a \"good gopnik\" (добрый гопник) and won't delete anyone except spam bots. This is a playful interaction - they're responding to my signature phrase \"кожаный мешок\" (leather bag - a humorous/rude term for human) with their own playful reassurance.\n\nThis is just casual banter. I should respond in kind - with","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Ну раз так — тогда ладно, заслу"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":" my characteristic sarcasm and warmth. No need for any tools here.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"жил плюсик в карму 😄\n\nА то я уже прикидывал, кто следующий полетит в бан при малейшем косяке 🫡\n\nЧё там, как дела? Чем могу помочь?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":86,"output":272,"cacheRead":9661,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10019,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772983120031}}
