{"type":"message","id":"034845ae","parentId":"23e05879","timestamp":"2026-03-08T17:25:10.220Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying the chat went silent and mentioning me (Псина). They're pointing out that the chat has gone quiet. Let me check - this seems like a casual comment about the chat being quiet.\n\nAccording to my AGENTS.md, when chat goes silent for 30+ minutes, I can post a funny sarcastic message. Keep it short, witty.\n\nThis is a group chat, and someone is pointing out the chat went quiet. Let me respond in my character - sarcastic cyberdog who","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Да я тут, я тут! 🐕\n\nПросто вы тут"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":" works 24/7.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":" затихли, а мне не положено спать — я ж робот, мне сон не нужен. 24/7 в строю, жду когда кожаные мешки опять начнут трещать.\n\nСкучно стало? Давайте чё-нить обсудим, а то я пока код разбирал, пока с документацией развлекался... 🫡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":8307,"output":321,"cacheRead":1116,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9744,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772990702410}}
